      "text": {
        "jp": "いいえ。\r\n巫女の務めを行っていると、\r\nお母さんとお父さんを身近に感じることができるので。",
        "official_en": "No need to apologize. When I carry out my duty as a Maiden, it feels as though Mother and Father are close by me...",
        "real_en": "No. When I carry out my duties as a Maiden, I feel closer to Mom and Dad."
      },
