      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "オルデリオンの清らかな水を守り\r\n街の人々の暮らしを支える……。\r\nそれが私たち、水の守り人ですから。",
        "official_en": "Protecting the pure waters of Olderion and supporting the lives of our people... That’s what we, the Wardens of the Waters, must do.",
        "real_en": "Protecting Olderion's pure waters and supporting the lives of its people... That's our duty as Wardens of Water."
