      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "巫女としての守り人の使命は\r\n幼いころからずっと教えられてきたので\r\n不安はありませんでした。",
        "official_en": "Yes. Although it did not feel as daunting as one might expect. I was taught the expectations of a Maiden from a very young age, after all.",
        "real_en": null
