      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "思っていたよりも早く\r\n大任に就くことになったってことか。",
        "official_en": "You had to take on the heavy responsibility of becoming a Maiden a lot earlier than you expected.",
        "real_en": "So you had to take on that responsibility sooner than you expected."
